-/*
- * iBoot's confinement registers on every CPU (fault-safe): CTRR_D bounds (EL2 bank
- * s3_0_c11_c1_2/3 and EL1 bank s3_0_c11_c0_2/3) and control (s3_0_c11_c1_5), CTXR_D bounds and
- * control (s3_0_c11_c3_0/1, s3_0_c11_c5_5) and ACC_CTXR_D (s3_0_c11_c8_0/1/7). macOS's woken boot
